OL,4,BRepublic of Ireland boss Ward signs    
OL,5,Bnew contract                           
OL,6,GRepublic of Ireland manager Carla Ward 
OL,7,Ghas signed a contract extension until  
OL,8,Gthe conclusion of the side's Euro 2029 
OL,9,Gcampaign.                              
OL,11,FThe 42-year-old's previous deal was    
OL,12,Fdue to expire at the end of this World 
OL,13,FCup qualification cycle but her future 
OL,14,Fhas now been resolved before next      
OL,15,Fmonth's two-legged play-off final      
OL,16,Fagainst Poland.                        
